    <string name="antikill_title">Keep monitoring alive</string>
    <string name="antikill_text">%1$s devices can stop this app automatically. Do these so monitoring keeps running:\n\n1. Autostart / background start — tap "Autostart settings" below\n2. Battery restriction — tap "Disable Battery Restriction" on the Setup page\n3. Display over other apps — helps the app start itself again\n\nIf it still gets stopped, the app revives itself within 3–15 minutes and will message you when it recovers. Tap "Test anti-kill" to prove it works on this phone.</string>
